  "notable_quotes": [
    "The reported CO2/N2 selectivity was derived for activated GUPT-1 after activation at 393 K using IAST from single-component isotherms, so it is model-based and activation-dependent.",
    "Simulations identify two CO2 binding modes in GUPT-1: electrostatic interaction with exposed -NH2 groups and C···O contacts with pyromellitic acid O atoms.",
    "Activated GUPT-1 shows high CO2/N2 adsorption selectivity of 118 under ambient conditions at 1 bar."
